@title Q3 2026 Sales Summary
@subtitle Foxglove Garden Centers, July to September 2026
@author Imani Okoro, Retail Finance Lead

# Q3 at a glance

kpi Q3 revenue | $5.87M | +8.3% vs Q3 2025 | good
kpi Best month | Sep, $2.24M | Jul $1.85M, Aug $1.78M | neutral
kpi Avg basket (Sep) | $42.70 | +$4.30 since Jul | good

September was the best month. Seasonal and holiday reached 23.2% of September revenue once autumn displays went up on 2026-09-08.

Plants is still the biggest category at 42.4% of the quarter.

Furniture fell 32.1% from July to September as patio season ended.

# Revenue by category

Figures are in thousands of dollars. Seasonal and holiday grew from a sliver of July sales to nearly a quarter of September. Furniture shrank as it did.

data rev = month,Plants,Tools and supplies,Furniture,Seasonal and holiday; Jul,820,410,530,90; Aug,760,390,480,150; Sep,910,450,360,520

