data basket = month,basket; Jul,38.40; Aug,39.10; Sep,42.70

chart line basket x=month y=basket title="Average basket size" unit=$ labels

# Watch items

!! Furniture needs a clearance decision. It fell from 530 in July to 360 in September (-32.1%), the only category to decline, and patio season is over.

- Decide whether to start a Furniture clearance.
- Plants (2490) and Tools and supplies (1250) held steady, so no action is needed there.
- Seasonal and holiday should keep climbing as holiday displays go up.
